Are you having trouble and in need of good initial values? Initial values should not affect the final result. Initial values can be set, yes. I sometimes set good initial values to speed up the optimization process, lowering the number of interactions until convergence.

However, the code you provided is to set the parameters for the PC-priors on these hyperparameters. This is something else and can affect the results.

Elias.

