Hi,

The time variability for SIR is not there, apart from a bump for some areas in the north at time 2018-3. See the plot from:

data$logSIR <- log(0.01 + data$cases) - log(0.01 + data$expected)

ggplot(data) + theme_minimal() +
    geom_sf(aes(fill = logSIR)) +
    facet_wrap(~ time) +
    scale_fill_viridis_c()

best regards,
Elias

